{"1-5":{"people":[{"id":"jesus-g2424g","name":"Jesus","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":1}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"G0189","lemma":"ἀκοή","tr":"akoē","gloss":"hearing","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":24},{"base":"G2122","lemma":"εὐκαίρως","tr":"eukairōs","gloss":"well timed","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"G2099","lemma":"εὐαγγελιστής","tr":"euangelistēs","gloss":"evangelist","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G2553","lemma":"κακοπαθέω","tr":"kakopatheō","gloss":"to endure","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G1624","lemma":"ἐκτρέπω","tr":"ektrepō","gloss":"to turn","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"G3454","lemma":"μῦθος","tr":"muthos","gloss":"myth","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"G2015","lemma":"ἐπιφάνεια","tr":"epiphaneia","gloss":"appearing","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"G3525","lemma":"νήφω","tr":"nēphō","gloss":"be sober","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"G4135","lemma":"πληροφορέω","tr":"plērophoreō","gloss":"to fulfill","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"G0654","lemma":"ἀποστρέφω","tr":"apostrephō","gloss":"to turn away","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":9}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2PE","chapter":2,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":40,"source":"openbible","text":"Now there were also false prophets among the people, just as there will be false teachers among you. They will secretly introduce destructive heresies, even denying the Master who bought them—bringing swift destruction on themselves.","from":3},{"book":"2PE","chapter":2,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":40,"source":"openbible","text":"In their greed, these false teachers will exploit you with deceptive words. The longstanding verdict against them remains in force, and their destruction does not sleep.","from":3},{"book":"2TI","chapter":3,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":35,"source":"openbible","text":"But understand this: In the last days terrible times will come.","from":3},{"book":"2TI","chapter":3,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":35,"source":"both","text":"They are the kind who worm their way into households and captivate vulnerable women who are weighed down with sins and led astray by various passions,","from":3},{"book":"ACT","chapter":10,"verse":42,"verseEnd":42,"votes":26,"source":"both","text":"And He commanded us to preach to the people and to testify that He is the One appointed by God to judge the living and the dead.","from":1},{"book":"1TI","chapter":4,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":26,"source":"openbible","text":"Now the Spirit expressly states that in later times some will abandon the faith to follow deceitful spirits and the teachings of demons,","from":3},{"book":"1TI","chapter":4,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":26,"source":"openbible","text":"They will prohibit marriage and require abstinence from certain foods that God has created to be received with thanksgiving by those who believe and know the truth.","from":3},{"book":"1TH","chapter":5,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":21,"source":"both","text":"And we urge you, brothers, to admonish the unruly, encourage the fainthearted, help the weak, and be patient with everyone.","from":2}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"6-8":{"people":[],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"G4689","lemma":"σπένδω","tr":"spendō","gloss":"to pour a libation","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"G1408","lemma":"δρόμος","tr":"dromos","gloss":"racecourse","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G0606","lemma":"ἀπόκειμαι","tr":"apokeimai","gloss":"to lay up","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"G0073","lemma":"ἀγών","tr":"agōn","gloss":"fight","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"G2015","lemma":"ἐπιφάνεια","tr":"epiphaneia","gloss":"appearing","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"G0075","lemma":"ἀγωνίζομαι","tr":"agōnizomai","gloss":"to struggle","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"G1473","lemma":"ἐγώ","tr":"egō","gloss":"I","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":841},{"base":"G3063","lemma":"λοιπόν","tr":"loipon","gloss":"henceforth","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":13},{"base":"G4735","lemma":"στέφανος","tr":"stephanos","gloss":"crown","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":18},{"base":"G2923","lemma":"κριτής","tr":"kritēs","gloss":"judge","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":19}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1TI","chapter":6,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":54,"source":"both","text":"Fight the good fight of the faith. Take hold of the eternal life to which you were called when you made the good confession before many witnesses.","from":7},{"book":"1CO","chapter":9,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":50,"source":"openbible","text":"Do you not know that in a race all the runners run, but only one receives the prize? Run in such a way as to take the prize.","from":7},{"book":"1CO","chapter":9,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":50,"source":"openbible","text":"No, I discipline my body and make it my slave, so that after I have preached to others, I myself will not be disqualified.","from":7},{"book":"JAS","chapter":1,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":38,"source":"both","text":"Blessed is the man who perseveres under trial, because when he has stood the test, he will receive the crown of life that God has promised to those who love Him.","from":8},{"book":"HEB","chapter":12,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":27,"source":"openbible","text":"Therefore, since we are surrounded by such a great cloud of witnesses, let us throw off every encumbrance and the sin that so easily entangles, and let us run with endurance the race set out for us.","from":7},{"book":"HEB","chapter":12,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":27,"source":"openbible","text":"Let us fix our eyes on Jesus, the author and perfecter of our faith, who for the joy set before Him endured the cross, scorning its shame, and sat down at the right hand of the throne of God.","from":7},{"book":"ACT","chapter":20,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":24,"source":"both","text":"But I consider my life of no value to me, if only I may finish my course and complete the ministry I have received from the Lord Jesus—the ministry of testifying to the good news of Godʼs grace.","from":7},{"book":"PHP","chapter":3,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":20,"source":"openbible","text":"Brothers, I do not consider myself yet to have taken hold of it. But one thing I do: Forgetting what is behind and straining toward what is ahead,","from":7}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"9-13":{"people":[{"id":"crescens-g2913","name":"Crescens","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"demas-g1214","name":"Demas","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"titus-g5103","name":"Titus","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"luke-g3065","name":"Luke","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"mark-g3138","name":"Mark","kind":"person","brief":"Paul's companian","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"tychicus-g5190","name":"Tychicus","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"carpus-g2591","name":"Carpus","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":13}],"places":[{"id":"dalmatia-g1149","name":"Dalmatia","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"galatia-g1053","name":"Galatia","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"thessalonica-g2332","name":"Thessalonica","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"ephesus-g2181","name":"Ephesus","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"troas-g5174","name":"Troas","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":13}],"words":[{"base":"G1214","lemma":"Δημᾶς","tr":"Dēmas","gloss":"Demas","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G2173","lemma":"εὔχρηστος","tr":"euchrēstos","gloss":"helpful","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G3065","lemma":"Λουκᾶς","tr":"Loukas","gloss":"Luke","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G3326","lemma":"μετά","tr":"meta","gloss":"with","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":465},{"base":"G1053","lemma":"Γαλατία","tr":"Galatia","gloss":"Galatia","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"G2332","lemma":"Θεσσαλονίκη","tr":"Thessalonikē","gloss":"Thessalonica","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"G5190","lemma":"Τυχικός","tr":"Tuchikos","gloss":"Tychicus","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"G5174","lemma":"Τρωάς","tr":"Trōas","gloss":"Troas","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"G2064","lemma":"ἔρχομαι","tr":"erchomai","gloss":"to come","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":631},{"base":"G3138","lemma":"Μάρκος","tr":"Markos","gloss":"Mark","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":8}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1JN","chapter":2,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":13,"source":"openbible","text":"Do not love the world or anything in the world. If anyone loves the world, the love of the Father is not in him.","from":10},{"book":"1JN","chapter":2,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":13,"source":"openbible","text":"For all that is in the world—the desires of the flesh, the desires of the eyes, and the pride of life—is not from the Father but from the world.","from":10},{"book":"2TI","chapter":1,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"You know that everyone in the Province of Asia has deserted me, including Phygelus and Hermogenes.","from":10},{"book":"ACT","chapter":12,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"And when he had realized this, he went to the house of Mary the mother of John, also called Mark, where many people had gathered together and were praying.","from":11},{"book":"COL","chapter":4,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":7,"source":"openbible","text":"Luke, the beloved physician, and Demas send you greetings.","from":10},{"book":"COL","chapter":4,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":7,"source":"openbible","text":"Greet the brothers in Laodicea, as well as Nympha and the church that meets at her house.","from":10},{"book":"1JN","chapter":5,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"because everyone born of God overcomes the world. And this is the victory that has overcome the world: our faith.","from":10},{"book":"1JN","chapter":5,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"Who then overcomes the world? Only he who believes that Jesus is the Son of God.","from":10}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"paul-circle","title":"Paul's Circle","people":5},{"id":"jerusalem-church","title":"The Jerusalem Church","people":2}]},"14-18":{"people":[{"id":"alexander-g0223j","name":"Alexander","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":14}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"G4506","lemma":"ῥύομαι","tr":"rhuomai","gloss":"to rescue","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":17},{"base":"G2962","lemma":"κύριος","tr":"kurios","gloss":"lord: God","lang":"g","inPassage":3,"uses":714},{"base":"G0165","lemma":"αἰών","tr":"aiōn","gloss":"an age: age","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":122},{"base":"G2041","lemma":"ἔργον","tr":"ergon","gloss":"work","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":169},{"base":"G0223","lemma":"Ἀλέξανδρος","tr":"Alexandros","gloss":"Alexander","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"G4135","lemma":"πληροφορέω","tr":"plērophoreō","gloss":"to fulfill","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"G1743","lemma":"ἐνδυναμόω","tr":"endunamoō","gloss":"to strengthen","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":7},{"base":"G0627","lemma":"ἀπολογία","tr":"apologia","gloss":"defence","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"G2782","lemma":"κήρυγμα","tr":"kērugma","gloss":"preaching","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"G3023","lemma":"λέων","tr":"leōn","gloss":"lion","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":9}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"PSA","chapter":121,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":46,"source":"both","text":"The LORD will guard you from all evil; He will preserve your soul.","from":18},{"book":"2TH","chapter":3,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":34,"source":"both","text":"But the Lord is faithful, and He will strengthen you and guard you from the evil one.","from":18},{"book":"JUD","chapter":1,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":28,"source":"both","text":"Now to Him who is able to keep you from stumbling and to present you unblemished in His glorious presence, with great joy—","from":18},{"book":"JUD","chapter":1,"verse":25,"verseEnd":25,"votes":28,"source":"openbible","text":"to the only God our Savior be glory, majesty, dominion, and authority through Jesus Christ our Lord before all time, and now, and for all eternity. Amen.","from":18},{"book":"MAT","chapter":6,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":20,"source":"both","text":"And lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from the evil one.’","from":18},{"book":"1TH","chapter":5,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":18,"source":"both","text":"Now may the God of peace Himself sanctify you completely, and may your entire spirit, soul, and body be kept blameless at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ.","from":18},{"book":"1PE","chapter":1,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":18,"source":"both","text":"who through faith are shielded by Godʼs power for the salvation that is ready to be revealed in the last time.","from":18},{"book":"PSA","chapter":73,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":17,"source":"both","text":"You guide me with Your counsel, and later receive me in glory.","from":18}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"19-22":{"people":[{"id":"aquila-g0207","name":"Aquila","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":19},{"id":"onesiphorus-g3683","name":"Onesiphorus","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":19},{"id":"priscilla-g4252","name":"Priscilla","kind":"person","brief":"Christian teacher","count":1,"firstVerse":19},{"id":"erastus-g2037","name":"Erastus","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"trophimus-g5161","name":"Trophimus","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"claudia-g2803","name":"Claudia","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"eubulus-g2103","name":"Eubulus","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"linus-g3044","name":"Linus","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"pudens-g4227","name":"Pudens","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"nero-g3505","name":"Nero","kind":"person","brief":"Roman Emperor","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"paul-g3972g","name":"Paul","kind":"person","brief":"An apostle","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"timothy-g5095g","name":"Timothy","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":22}],"places":[{"id":"corinth-g2882","name":"Corinth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"miletus-g3399","name":"Miletus","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"ephesus-g2181","name":"Ephesus","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"rome-g4514","name":"Rome","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":22}],"words":[{"base":"G0782","lemma":"ἀσπάζομαι","tr":"aspazomai","gloss":"to pay respects to","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":60},{"base":"G3683","lemma":"Ὀνησίφορος","tr":"Onēsiphoros","gloss":"Onesiphorus","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"G2037","lemma":"Ἔραστος","tr":"erastos","gloss":"Erastus","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G3399","lemma":"Μίλητος","tr":"Milētos","gloss":"Miletus","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G4251","lemma":"Πρίσκα","tr":"Priska","gloss":"Prisca","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G5161","lemma":"Τρόφιμος","tr":"Trophimos","gloss":"Trophimus","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"G3326","lemma":"μετά","tr":"meta","gloss":"with","lang":"g","inPassage":2,"uses":465},{"base":"G0207","lemma":"Ἀκύλας","tr":"Akulas","gloss":"Aquila","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"G2882","lemma":"Κόρινθος","tr":"Korinthos","gloss":"Corinth","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6},{"base":"G5494","lemma":"χειμών","tr":"cheimōn","gloss":"winter","lang":"g","inPassage":1,"uses":6}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"PHM","chapter":1,"verse":25,"verseEnd":25,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit.","from":22},{"book":"ACT","chapter":18,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"There he found a Jew named Aquila, a native of Pontus, who had recently come from Italy with his wife Priscilla because Claudius had ordered all the Jews to leave Rome. Paul went to visit them,","from":19},{"book":"1CO","chapter":16,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"The churches in the province of Asia send you greetings. Aquila and Prisca greet you warmly in the Lord, and so does the church that meets at their house.","from":19},{"book":"GAL","chapter":6,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit, brothers. Amen.","from":22},{"book":"ACT","chapter":20,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Paul was accompanied by Sopater son of Pyrrhus from Berea, Aristarchus and Secundus from Thessalonica, Gaius from Derbe, Timothy, and Tychicus and Trophimus from the province of Asia.","from":20},{"book":"ROM","chapter":16,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"Greet Prisca and Aquila, my fellow workers in Christ Jesus,","from":19},{"book":"ROM","chapter":16,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"who have risked their lives for me. Not only I but all the churches of the Gentiles are grateful to them.","from":19},{"book":"COL","chapter":4,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"This greeting is in my own hand—Paul. Remember my chains. Grace be with you.","from":22}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"paul-circle","title":"Paul's Circle","people":5},{"id":"roman-officials","title":"Roman Officials","people":2}]}}